  "caveats": [
    "Encounter candidates are metadata probes, not completed-battle evidence.",
    "Three forms have separate flags; normal-only151 and any-form151 are distinct targets.",
    "Calendar advancement and RNG forcing must never be represented as ordinary successful play.",
    "All campaign completion evidence must preserve root campaignId across phase transitions.",
    "Battle events must run app-equivalent dex/session/Flash hooks.",
    "Native move runtime requires data.timelines, otherwise engine uses fallback behavior."
  ]
